OL,3,GNEWSA'Critical' repairs under way at
OL,4,A11th Century castle
OL,5,
OL,6,FCritical works are under way to repair
OL,7,Fan 11th century castle on the western
OL,8,Fcoast of the Isle of Man, after
OL,9,Fexposure to the elements left the outer
OL,10,Fwalls "in a fragile state".
OL,12,FConstructed by the Vikings, Peel Castle
OL,13,Fis one of the Isle of Man's most
OL,14,Fhistoric and popular sites, with
OL,15,Fthousands of people visiting it every
OL,16,Fyear.
OL,18,FThe fortress, which stands on St
OL,19,FPatrick's Isle, is known for
OL,20,Farchaeological finds including the
OL,21,Fgrave of the 'Pagan Lady' in which a
OL,22,FViking necklace was found.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
