OL,3,GNEWSA'Critical' repairs under way at
OL,4,A11th Century castle
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn-Paul Walker, of Manx National
OL,7,FHeritage (MHH), called it an "important
OL,8,Fstep in safeguarding one of the Isle of
OL,9,FMan's most iconic historic sites
OL,10,Fagainst the challenges of time and its
OL,11,Fexposed coastal setting".
